# Salt used to hash learner ULNs in analytics.db.
# Share this value with collaborators OUT OF BAND (password manager, etc.)
# — never commit the real .env to git.
#
# To initialise a new repo:
#   python3 scripts/db.py init   # generates a fresh salt and writes .env
#
# To match an existing collaborator's DB, copy their salt verbatim here.
MODERATION_HASH_SALT=
